  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/407/668/bh_jof_title.png\" width=\"&quot;100%\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">Fabric 版本需要 <span style=\"color:#9c0\">Fabric API</span></span></strong>&nbsp;<strong>與 <span style=\"color:#f60\">ClothConfig</span>。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkreezcraft.com%252fjump_over_fences_forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/407/666/bh_jof_bisect.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting: Code Kreezxil: 25% off 1st Month&#x27;s Rent\" width=\"1429\" height=\"229\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果您希望零設定就能輕鬆架設任何整合包伺服器，可選擇 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkreezcraft.com%252fjump_over_fences_forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting 伺服器方案</a>，並輸入優惠碼 kreezxil 享有新客戶首月 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/407/667/bh_jof_overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"117\">本模組為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fence-jumper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fence-jumper</a>&nbsp;移植版，原作者為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/therealp455w0rd\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheRealp455w0rd</a>&nbsp;，已基於 MIT 授權協議移植至 1.16.4+ 版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>當高牆與柵欄阻擋去路時別煩惱，現在您可直接跳越它們！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組僅需安裝於客戶端。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>無需額外申請權限，直接加入遊戲即可生效。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/407/665/bh_jof_community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ngNQjT5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/96753964485181440/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/kreezxil\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cwhDBkE.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fMinecraftModdedForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/dWeRuXB.png\"></a></p>",
